<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (Traditional parking management systems are often inefficient, leading to inaccurate tracking, frequent billing disputes, and customer dissatisfaction. The absence of dynamic pricing capabilities results in missed revenue opportunities, while reliance on manual processes makes systems prone to human error and lacks transparency in fare calculation. These significant challenges underscore the urgent need for a more advanced, automated, and reliable parking solution.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
